  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will work to promote effective mechanisms to secure land and resource rights and improve land governance systems, working directly with Indigenous Peoples and Local Communities (IPLCs). This project focuses on Sub-Saharan Africa, Latin America, and South Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
